{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "51f4f96eb13622f2afa7424681ba51f9e44399d958776e32ce7a402c85929131", "ja": "想いは時にミラクル", "zh": "心意有时会化为奇迹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "15a743c34383b090b220643168dd56dee095fcce548344d234fe601c795ea3f3", "ja": "番組は大好評を博し、劇場でも急遽公演が\n行われるほどだった。VTRを応募した生徒\nも親友と仲直りでき、その姿に奇跡を信じた\nのり子は、仲間にも背中を押され、ずっと\n疎遠だった友達に電話をかけるのだった。", "zh": "节目大受好评，甚至临时在剧场\n举行了公演。提交VTR的学生也和\n最好的朋友重归于好，相信奇迹的\n律子在伙伴们的鼓励下，给一直疏远的朋友打去了电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed4fc27e41d2e4f115f246a3a6991a2c765c9f4948023e339cd54ecf62748c40", "ja": "（卒業式の番組が大好評につき、急遽、劇場でも\n公演を行うことになった。『卒業生フリーライブ』だ）", "zh": "（毕业典礼节目大受好评，因此决定临时也在剧场举办演出。这就是《毕业生自由演唱会》）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f83a535c7d02975811321c4cec7069e51fdf11bf48fc08e37610560156f79a95", "ja": "（お客さん一人一人にみんながお花のピンをつけてあげ\nるお見送りも好評だったようだ……うーん。青春）", "zh": "（给每位观众别上花朵胸针的送别环节似乎也很受欢迎……嗯，这就是青春啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5dbf075544b64aec13c6e9bdf23f42528607a2b9b6224b5c09270f9320aeb99b", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。番組から感想の手紙がたくさん\n届いているぞ。結菜さんと爽子さんからのも……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。节目组寄来了很多写着感想的信。结菜小姐和爽子小姐的也有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "6a2c380ef36fa64f30a5e96d1e2e4a6000c259fce308fca7764c07630ebc8651", "ja": "わあ！　見たい見たい！　てかさ、あの二人本当に\n良かったよね。ちゃんと仲直りもできてさ。", "zh": "哇！我想看我想看！话说回来，那两个人真的很棒呢。还顺利和好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0cffcfd986c7b3ded4ce5ab9ffc8ac401f010c481ce9b517bf973cb317ad7b7a", "ja": "うんうん。結菜さんの切実な気持ちと、みんなの\nコラボがめぐりあって起こった奇跡だな。", "zh": "嗯嗯。是結菜小姐真挚的心意和大家的合作相遇后引发的奇迹啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "f3a10e998b3c7cdd8a0c355326b900b2287cfc5727b3e9df1c7338058d98401d", "ja": "奇跡か～。ま、そうだよね。人の思いってさ、\nたまにすごいミラクルを起こすよね。", "zh": "奇迹啊～。不过也是呢。人的心意这种东西，\n有时真的会引发不可思议的奇迹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "a0c80aa5f3873c6d969760ea5b34e763073992e6b2690c39f8c2a6cae42aaa60", "ja": "ふふっ。私も色々思い出しちゃいました。\n青春って、いいなぁ……なんて♪", "zh": "呵呵，我也想起了好多事情。青春啊，真好……我不禁这么想♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "b9d7ddf7c3a3aeb7637e33193b2546910887b435d3cd235db08eb85d21597493", "ja": "あずささんだって、まだまだ青春真っ只中ですよね？\nほら、青春って『カワラナイモノ』ですから！", "zh": "就连梓小姐也还正值青春年华吧？  \n你看，青春就是『カワラナイモノ』嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "9876b5dae0a4d7ec44474a1dad84263832e2d616be96dab31057faf4a3173537", "ja": "そうね。失ったように見えていたのに、変わらないで\nいたもの……そういうものに気づけた気がするわ。", "zh": "是啊。明明看起来像是已经失去了，却依然没有改变的东西……我好像注意到了这样的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "914f2d3434a1f339652c68c507a13dd1f7fc36d390bae99fa74d18d2de38a074", "ja": "？　のり子さん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "？诺莉子小姐，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "76d87d5af45eb138fe85979ae83eb48cf5b38e9515b59b83dd9cd2ae0ba56814", "ja": "……あー、あのさ。みんなに聞いてほしい話が\nあるんだけど……。聞いてもらえる？", "zh": "……啊——那个。我有件事想跟\n大家说说……能听我讲讲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "a500214c09b27583e6063635a1221fb47e05fbb172a5ff35a611dde525015703", "ja": "もちろん、です……！", "zh": "当然可以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "3c92fdf07a35784116a2f3daec3af01902404ce1ea84d489e8f504aedc32ed25", "ja": "ありがと。……アタシ、結菜ちゃんみたいに、\n卒業式の前に友達をなくしちゃったことがあるんだ。", "zh": "谢谢。……我以前也像结菜一样，在毕业典礼前失去了朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "f5553c36c639d858557433c5922318a0f568814e653a40297263411528ebc2ec", "ja": "え、そうなんですか！？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "11182d946982585432cbde60cb6f93d85c09a0cda4ba5908cec5d7016e7f8d28", "ja": "うん。その子は結局、卒業式に来なくってさ。\nだから、結菜ちゃんの役に立ててホント良かった。", "zh": "嗯。那孩子最后没来参加毕业典礼。\n所以能帮上结菜的忙，真的太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "fbfe104d995b247b3e4c5ee0631f85e98ef116009db4f7273865642ea796e442", "ja": "アタシのもやもやも、ちょっと成仏したかな～、\nなんてね。あはは。", "zh": "我的郁闷也算是稍微释怀了吧～开玩笑的。啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "f60c2b75ba5bbbd76aadecd3caf33e32ab26ae0ecab2b87e35fff3cc3681ea15", "ja": "の……のり子さん。", "zh": "那……那个，纪子小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "4ccecd50df29a679796e15ab20079187b78da10eb11c9f1d4ce2df1412475ccb", "ja": "れ、連絡、してみたらどうですか？\nそのお友達……。", "zh": "试、试着联系一下怎么样？\n那位朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "08bd89bdc2d268d357d7dfcb7cc3ccb16318c0ddbb6f23fbbb614cd07295d948", "ja": "連絡……いや～、今さらすぎるんじゃないかな？\n今あの子がどんな状況かもわかんないしさ……。", "zh": "联系……不，会不会现在才联系已经太迟了？而且我也不知道那孩子现在是什么情况……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "dd7158208af70842c7e281883176a19ec1b690426c81e0179e96698ac2f27ab1", "ja": "だ、だからです！　だってのり子さん、\n後悔してますよね！？　顔を見れば……わかります！", "zh": "所、所以才这样啊！因为诺莉子小姐，你很后悔吧！？看你的表情……就知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f162d1ff3e20b7f5e54a51a51a496796067a3ffa4c03658a4b80ef192d349a8", "ja": "うっ……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "8e390be6e4cacdca8a5b1275c4b74242234cae806ec99ffa152850fc75e8493b", "ja": "のり子ちゃん。信じちゃっていいんじゃない？\n『奇跡』を。", "zh": "德莉子。相信“奇迹”也没什么不好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "42c881628f6ec465b845d891183dd7457fe8419c71a01b1fbf05eb369dfcf1e3", "ja": "そうですよ！　のり子さんもさっき言ってたじゃない\nですか、「人の思いはすごいミラクルを起こす」って！", "zh": "是啊！诺莉子小姐刚才不是也说过吗，“人的心意能创造出惊人的奇迹”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "0dd3a449e3a5764db892dc0b8430f0b158d189876c24385a5819ef60a285fbc4", "ja": "で、でも、ほんと時間たっちゃったし……！", "zh": "可、可是，真的已经过去很久了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c52862ef236286d6b6945b4cb1be95545879ec62f5d6f23ef838ef123a306095", "ja": "のり子の友達への思いが変わってないなら、\n友達ののり子への思いも、同じかもしれない。", "zh": "如果纪子的朋友对她的心意没有改变，\n那朋友对纪子的心意，说不定也一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1028_p", "source_sha256": "76afc80f273307e9d14c295db21873e0831378bea49f20f8b511ae40cf1ae9da", "ja": "今回の仕事が来たことも、結菜さんが来たことも。\nちょっとした『奇跡』って気がするな。", "zh": "这次接到这份工作也好，结菜小姐的到来也好。我觉得都算是小小的“奇迹”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "a903059d51bbb8384e65018fc94738434ce8bb147d336400cf5946ace80b2562", "ja": "……。うん、そう……そうだよね。\n電話、かけてみるよ！", "zh": "……嗯，也是……你说得对呢。\n我这就打电话试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1030_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1031_se", "source_sha256": "8eb5adbe0617ac426f92edae8d981b84eeb3249735348f0c423fbd42e1c23976", "ja": "プルルルル……プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟——嘟——……嘟——嘟——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1032_asuka", "source_sha256": "a653376981fcc837d6582caefc519f2290441497d43d5dffc2dedb93e9ed55f1", "ja": "のり子！？　え、のり子だよね！？\nどうしたの！？", "zh": "诺莉子！？　诶，你是诺莉子吧！？\n怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "61a7f4c89dd5770a15853daec7c7ca3b3d127c01f44f47bdcfee3329a72fc277", "ja": "あ、明日香……！", "zh": "啊、明日香……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1034_asuka", "source_sha256": "9b0963ca9a1d6adaebb41500b07fcd4d9c6776e41cc8c5b0266e4ec71a49a0ed", "ja": "やだもー！　めっちゃ嬉しいんだけど！\nてか活躍見てるよ！　マジ見てる！", "zh": "讨厌啦——！我超级开心的好嘛！\n话说我一直有关注你的活跃哦！真的有看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "09e317984d3e798e7989b1518061459b5feb0435254a6989f52f7d0ab8239f36", "ja": "明日香、あのさ、あの時はごめんね。\nアタシ、今まで連絡する勇気がなくて……。", "zh": "明日香，那个……之前的事，对不起。\n我一直都没有勇气联系你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1036_asuka", "source_sha256": "bb0863793132167e5eeedc2ab31243c7c68b75d72dec577f33edcda4e7de72c8", "ja": "ううん、のり子がいてくれて、私は学校生活楽しかった\nよ。め～っちゃ感謝してる！", "zh": "不，有法子陪着我，我的校园生活过得很开心。\n我真的特别感谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1038_asuka", "source_sha256": "7af529cbe315bb0d0ae885ca2c0629d3a089d958ee8becff418ea131ef00c7c8", "ja": "最後はああなっちゃったけど、今はもう大丈夫だし！\n……って泣いてる！？　どしたん？　え、え！？", "zh": "虽然最后变成那样了，但现在已经没事了！\n……结果在哭！？怎么了？诶，诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1039_043nor", "source_sha256": "ed0274dbefe13a1222d46b6abba5e1013124937ca57a5e5c174393582e496de7", "ja": "……ははっ！　なんでもない！　ぐすっ……。\nねえ、そっちはどんな感じ？　話聞かせてよ……！", "zh": "……哈哈！没什么！抽泣……\n对了，你那边怎么样？说给我听听吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1040_p", "source_sha256": "333a5c25c1d4bbba5a21ff077c273c4ea7f45b6be66ced2c9ae33f2cab4642b9", "ja": "（一歩踏み出せば、気が付ける。どんなに変わってしま\nったように見えても、ずっとそこにあったものに……）", "zh": "（只要向前迈出一步，就能察觉到。无论看起来变化有多大，那些一直都在那里存在的东西……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0420_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0420_story_07_1041_p", "source_sha256": "a7285c3f701077bc00f1eb1f78323c8735fd1ba807390a849463a210ac52a039", "ja": "（偶然の切っ掛けひとつで、そういうものは他にも\nたくさんあることに……気付けるかもしれないな！）", "zh": "说不定只因一个偶然的契机，就能注意到……原来还有很多这样的事啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
